{"id":"2e0ff63492b640d7","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter2 Image Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter2-image-filter — ZFC Filter2 Image Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter2-image-filter — ZFC Filter2 Image Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter2-image-filter — ZFC Filter2 Image Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal I,A,B\\in V\">\\(X,Y,f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal I,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ImageFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ImageFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}image\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ImageFilter}_S(\\mathcal I,f,\\mathcal F,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land \\mathcal I=\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(Y):\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(f[A]\\subseteq B)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(Y),\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(Y)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}image\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ImageFilter}_S(\\mathcal I,f,\\mathcal F,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land \\mathcal I=\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(Y):\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(f[A]\\subseteq B)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(Y),\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(Y)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order supplied to the sourced filter predicate is the set-coded inclusion order.  With this orientation its upward-closure clause is exactly closure under supersets; using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\supseteq\">\\(\\supseteq\\)</span> reverses the filter law.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-filter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,f,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal I,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ImageFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}image\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter2ImageFilter}_S(\\mathcal I,f,\\mathcal F,Y)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow \\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land \\mathcal I=\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(Y):\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(f[A]\\subseteq B)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(Y),\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(Y)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\supseteq","display":false}],"bytes":1431,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1894","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter2-image-filter]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1331244a5201bb99","36d7463d215be751"]}